  <div class="why-matters">
    <h4>🌍 Why This Matters</h4>
    <p><strong>For Research Teams:</strong> Data scientists work independently on experiments. With DVC, they can push their data and pipelines to shared storage. Colleagues can reproduce experiments exactly, verify results, and build on top of successful approaches.</p>
    <p><strong>For Production Deployments:</strong> Models need to reference exact data versions used for training. DVC creates an immutable audit trail: this model was trained on data version X on date Y with code version Z. If the model fails in production, you can reproduce training conditions exactly.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- KEY TAKEAWAY -->
  <div class="key-takeaway">
    <h4>✦ Key Takeaways</h4>
