      <li><code>dvc remote add</code> configures where data will be stored</li>
      <li><code>dvc add</code> tracks files; <code>dvc push/pull</code> sync data to remote</li>
      <li><code>git add</code> the .dvc files; they're small metadata, safe for Git</li>
      <li>Collaboration is identical to Git: clone, pull, and you get all data</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
